{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a7c3e1d0-9b24-4f11-8c6a-jibutax-oscu-01",
    "name": "JibuTax OSCU (Role 3)",
    "description": "Cryptographic eTIMS simulator + SMS/WhatsApp QR dispatcher.\n\nStart the API first (SMS and WhatsApp stay mocked until you add keys):\n\n  cd backend\n  ../.venv/bin/uvicorn app.main:app --reload --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000\n\nThen run folder 2 (File invoices) before folder 3 (Lookup). Filing Safari Builders saves invoice_number and control_code for the later GETs.\n\nExpected cement totals: taxable 200000, VAT 32000, grand 232000. sms_status and whatsapp_status should be \"mocked\".",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000" },
    { "key": "invoice_number", "value": "" },
    { "key": "control_code", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET health",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('API is up', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().ok).to.eql(true);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. Tax preview (no SMS, no seal)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Preview cement 16% (happy path)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('16% VAT on 200000 = 32000, grand 232000', function () {",
                  "  pm.expect(Number(json.total_standard_amount)).to.eql(200000);",
                  "  pm.expect(Number(json.total_standard_vat)).to.eql(32000);",
                  "  pm.expect(Number(json.grand_total)).to.eql(232000);",
                  "  pm.expect(json.lines[0].tax_class).to.eql('STANDARD_16');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"bags of cement\",\n      \"quantity\": 100,\n      \"unit_price\": 2000\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invoices/preview"
          }
        },
